{
  "key": "chain/tape-dust",
  "kind": "chain",
  "summary": "Worn-tape character: fewer bits, high end rolled off, a dark dotted-8th echo",
  "tags": [
    "lofi",
    "dusty",
    "vintage",
    "tape",
    "darker",
    "warm",
    "old"
  ],
  "devices": [
    "Crusher",
    "Revamp",
    "Delay"
  ],
  "links": [
    "production/lofi"
  ],
  "checked": {
    "how": "written",
    "by": "claude (knowledge seed)",
    "date": "2026-11-12",
    "opendaw": "652e6ca"
  },
  "body": [
    "Crusher for grit, Revamp's low-pass for the dull top, a filtered dotted-8th Delay low in the mix. amount turns the crushing, the low-pass and the echo together.",
    "On the master it ages the whole track; on drums, keep amount at 0–1 or the hats turn to fizz."
  ],
  "apply": {
    "params": {
      "track": {
        "type": "track"
      },
      "amount": {
        "type": "amount"
      }
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "op": "add_effect",
        "input": {
          "track": "$track",
          "effect": "Crusher",
          "settings": [
            {
              "param": "bits",
              "value": {
                "dial": [
                  14,
                  8
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "param": "crush",
              "value": {
                "dial": [
                  0,
                  0.3
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "param": "mix",
              "value": {
                "dial": [
                  0.3,
                  0.7
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "op": "add_effect",
        "input": {
          "track": "$track",
          "effect": "Revamp",
          "settings": [
            {
              "param": "lowPass/enabled",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "param": "lowPass/frequency",
              "value": {
                "dial": [
                  10000,
                  3200
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "param": "lowPass/order",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "param": "highPass/frequency",
              "value": 40
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "op": "add_effect",
        "input": {
          "track": "$track",
          "effect": "Delay",
          "settings": [
            {
              "param": "delayMusical",
              "value": 13
            },
            {
              "param": "feedback",
              "value": 0.35
            },
            {
              "param": "cross",
              "value": 0.4
            },
            {
              "param": "filter",
              "value": -0.5
            },
            {
              "param": "wet",
              "value": {
                "dial": [
                  -30,
                  -16
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
